{"t":"Ice Fishing","s":"ice-fishing-5a142","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Ice_fishing_1_7319ad.jpg","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>Ice fishing is a way to get <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perch</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\">Northern Pike</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trout</a>. You can also obtain the achievement Exquisite Taste through ice fishing.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Items\">Required Items</span></h2>\n<p>• <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a><br/>\n• <a href=\"#/wiki/Fishing%20Rod\">Fishing Rod</a><br/>\n• Worms\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-How_to_Fish\">How to Fish</span></h2>\n<p>You can find many areas in Svargrond to ice fish.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Step_1:_Find_a_Spot\">Step 1: Find a Spot</span></h3>\n<p>Look around the <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a> area on the ice sheets for small cracks in the ice. They're all over places where the ice is near water in Svargrond, as well as hunting spots. The biggest place is probably on <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ice fishing 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_fishing_1_7319ad.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Step_2:_Pick_the_Spot\">Step 2: Pick the Spot</span></h3>\n<p>Use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">pick</a> on the fragile ice to open it.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ice fishing 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_fishing_2_22e41f.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></span>\n</p><p>When you've finished picking the weak place in the ice, you will see fish swimming under the ice: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Icehole2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Icehole2_2a4744.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ice fishing 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_fishing_3_0a0d96.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"w-Step_3:_Fish.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Step_3:_Fish!\">Step 3: Fish!</span></h3>\n<p>Use your <a href=\"#/wiki/Fishing%20Rod\">fishing rod</a> on the ice hole. Just as normal fishing, it may take a few tries, depending on your luck and your Fishing level. The fish you catch will appear in the same container that your <a href=\"#/wiki/Fishing%20Rod\">fishing rod</a> is in. You can only catch <b>one fish</b> from each hole per pick of that hole. Don't forget your worms!\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ice fishing 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_fishing_4_351dd5.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></span>\n</p><p>After 15 minutes, the hole will freeze over again, and you can repeat the ice fishing process for another fish.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Statistics\">Statistics</span></h2>\n<p><b>Ice Fishing, 3138 trials.</b><br/><br/>\n</p>\n<table class=\"loot_list sortable tw-cmd\" data-command=\"update-stats\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Item<br/></th>\n<th>Amount<br/></th>\n<th>Percentage<br/></th>\n<th>Tries to get 1<br/></th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\"><img alt=\"Fish\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fish_332645.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"> 2868</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">91.4%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\"><img alt=\"Green Perch\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Perch_8933ab.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perch</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"> 164</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">5.23%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\"><img alt=\"Northern Pike\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Northern_Pike_8e10b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\">Northern Pike</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"> 68</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">2.17%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">47</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\"><img alt=\"Rainbow Trout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rainbow_Trout_b08ae9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trout</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"> 38</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1.21%</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">83</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Older Statistics:</b>\n</p><p>Each <b>1000</b> fished:<br/>\n56 Green Perches<br/>\n32 Northern Pikes<br/>\n8 Rainbow Trouts\n</p><p>• <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\"><img alt=\"Fish\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fish_332645.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">Fish</a> (Common)<br/>\n• <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\"><img alt=\"Green Perch\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Perch_8933ab.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perch</a> (5.6% - Semi-rare)<br/>\n• <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\"><img alt=\"Northern Pike\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Northern_Pike_8e10b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\">Northern Pike</a> (3.2% - Rare)<br/>\n• <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\"><img alt=\"Rainbow Trout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rainbow_Trout_b08ae9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trout</a> (0.8% - Very Rare)\n</p></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest","sinatuki-quest"]}